        "content": "## 📅 NEW: Weekly Substitute Workload Digest\nAn independent branch on its own schedule trigger. Every Monday morning it reads the payroll log, aggregates hours per substitute, flags anyone over/under-loaded, and posts a fairness digest to Slack — a reporting capability v1 didn't have at all."
